gue and mild neuropathy symptoms that have not required additional treatment. Vital signs have generally been within normal limits during routine check-ups.\n\nOverall, Julie Davis continues to manage her Type 2 diabetes effectively with lifestyle modifications and current pharmacotherapy. She adheres to her treatment plan and demonstrates a good understanding of her condition, which bodes well for her ongoing health management.\n"
